OL,3,GNEWSAReports of injuries after bus
OL,4,Acrashes into tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus has crashed into a tree near West
OL,7,FBromwich bus station prompting an
OL,8,Femergency service response.
OL,10,FThe incident happened on New Street at
OL,11,Faround 09:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,13,FWest Midlands Police said officers were
OL,14,Fat the scene alongside other emergency
OL,15,Fservice colleagues and inquiries into
OL,16,Fthe circumstances were ongoing.
