OL,3,GNEWSAReports of injuries after bus
OL,4,Acrashes into tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Fire Service said crews
OL,7,Fwere called to reports of a
OL,8,Fsingle-vehicle road traffic collision
OL,9,Fat 09:04 and there had been reports of
OL,10,Finjuries. Police have appealed for
OL,11,Fanyone who witnessed the crash to
OL,12,Fcontact them.
